    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Execute advanced multi-pronged attacks.</h2>Focus on getting the right units out at the right time. They'll call for transport to the enemy beachhead themselves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supplement your attacks with powerful superweapons.</h2>Does the enemy base need a few of your battleships in it? Yes. Yes it does.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your army to fit your playstyle.</h2>Decide if you want to overwhelm your opponent with hordes of infantry, build unstoppable tanks that can run over enemy vehicles, or sit back and decimate them with airstrikes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quickly command the entire battlefield.</h2>Project 37 uses a lane-based movement system that allows units to move with greater autonomy. Just build the units and they'll figure out where to go.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Execute advanced multi-pronged attacks.</h2>Focus on getting the right units out at the right time. They'll call for transport to the enemy beachhead themselves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/3e4ac3c887b15bd6c9e83c50cd0a1c1d.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supplement your attacks with powerful superweapons.</h2>Does the enemy base need a few of your battleships in it? Yes. Yes it does.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/b221c6d88786b3fe7d5c64a581951e0d.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your army to fit your playstyle.</h2>Decide if you want to overwhelm your opponent with hordes of infantry, build unstoppable tanks that can run over enemy vehicles, or sit back and decimate them with airstrikes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/e7b67f43ecced26eddf0b166d366360c.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quickly command the entire battlefield.</h2>Project 37 uses a lane-based movement system that allows units to move with greater autonomy. Just build the units and they'll figure out where to go.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.poster.avif?t=1738202080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.webm?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894750/extras/a34b8ecf50096007c43be5831bb258e2.mp4?t=1738202080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
